      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors describe 5 patients with Parkinson's disease with coexistent sensory symptoms, mainly pains. In the light of the pertinent literature the authors regard pain as one of the symptoms in the parkinsonian syndrome. Diagnostic and therapeutic difficulties in this form of parkinsonism are stressed."},
